s that stained with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Frederick Carl Koerner  M D  Signed On  02 REMOVED_MONTH 98 at 07 23 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  right breast mass   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm breast excision specimen  with an overlying REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm skin ellipse with 1 knot designating the lateral margin and 2 knots designating the superior margin  The breast is inked and serially sectioned to reveal a tan  firm  stellate mass  measuring 1 9cm in greatest dimension  grossly coming to within 0 4cm from the closest superior and inferior margins  The remainder of the breast parenchyma is grossly unremarkable  SECTION CODE  A B  Tumor in relation to closest superior margin  C D  Tumor in relation to closest inferior margin  E   Representative section of uninvolved breast tissue  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  superior lateral margin   is an unoriented REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm piece of fibrofatty tissue  with punctate areas of hemorrhage  The specimen is serially sectioned and submitted entirely in Cassettes F L  Received fresh   labeled REMOVE_PATIENT_NAME  patient s name  unit number  and  Right axillary contents   is an REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 2 0cm piece of fat  dissected through the multiple grossly unremarkable lymph nodes  Representative sections of the lymph nodes are submitted in Cassettes M P  Resident  SAHA SADEGHI  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     GROSS DIAGNOSIS  1  BREAST  RIGHT  BIOPSY  INVASIVE CARCINOMA REMOVED_DATE CM FROM SUPERIOR MARGIN  O R  Resident  MARYAM S  MOHAMMADKHANI  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Joseph Misdraji  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCES