arts  Labeled  left axillary contents  Levels 1  2  and 3   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 0cm fragment of fibroadipose tissue  Ten lymph nodes are dissected from this fragment  ranging in size from REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm  All these specimens are bisected  Labeled  left axillary Level 2   are two fragments of fibroadipose tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm  Two lymph nodes measuring in size from REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 1cm to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm are dissected  The larger of the two is bisected  Labeled  Level 3 node   is a fragment of fibroadipose tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 4cm  A REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 2cm lymph node is dissected from this fragment  SECTION CODE  N Q  dissected lymph nodes from axillary contents labeled  Levels 1  2  and 3  R  two lymph node dissected from Level II S  Level III lymph node  Resident  M  Priscilla Short  M D      INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1  BREAST LEFT REEXCISION  DENSE FIBROSIS  NO DEFINITE TUMOR CELLS SEEN IN ONE REPRESENTATIVE SECTION  O R  Resident  FANG FANG  MD O R  Diagnosis by  John H  Eichhorn  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Michele Annette Gadd  M D  Martha Elizabeth Meaney  M D  PART A  BREAST  LEFT   RE EXCISION PART B  LEFT AXILLARY CONTENTS LEVEL 1  REMOVED_DATE PART C  LEFT AXILLARY LEVEL 2 PART D  LEFT AXILLARY LEVEL 3 , Unchecked.
