TE x 0 4cm REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 5cm  The specimen is serially sectioned to reveal adipose and fibrous area with no clear nodularity  The specimen is entirely submitted in cassettes AA GG  Resident  MASSIMO D APUZZO  MD PhD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART A  BREAST LEFT  EXCISIONAL BIOPSY PART B  BREAST LEFT MEDIAL HALF OF CAVITY  FINAL SHAVED MA PART C  BREAST LEFT LATERAL HALF OF CAVITY  FINAL SHAVED M , Unchecked.
