men  with posterolateral margin  C  biopsy cavity and lesion at lateral margin  with medial surface removed  D  lesion at posterolateral margin  E  biopsy cavity from mid area of specimen surface removed F G  biopsy cavity  at lateral margin of specimen  in the superior portion  H  lesion in lateral aspect of specimen I  superior margin Resident  JUSTIN M  CATES  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT    REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID  REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  Michael V Seiden  M D  Simon Powell  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT   PARTIAL MASTECTOMY , Unchecked.
